{"id":67386,"date":"2025-02-16T19:42:50","date_gmt":"2025-02-16T18:42:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67386"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:08:43","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:08:43","slug":"trail-lagoa-de-obidos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-lagoa-de-obidos\/","title":{"rendered":"1\u00ba Trail Trilhos da Lagoa de \u00d3bidos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">1\u00ba Trail Trilhos da Lagoa de \u00d3bidos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1\u00ba Trail Trilhos da Lagoa de \u00d3bidos 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, tendo como ponto nevr\u00e1lgico a localidade do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Arelho<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">\u00d3bidos<\/strong> (distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Leiria<\/strong>). Com partidas escalonadas a partir das <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:00<\/strong> junto ao <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Centro Cultural, Social e Recreativo Arelhense<\/strong>, esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o inaugural leva-te a descobrir os trilhos naturais que serpenteiam as margens do maior sistema lagunar costeiro da costa portuguesa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A prova desenrola-se por caminhos agr\u00edcolas, manchas florestais, linhas de \u00e1gua e encostas com vistas panor\u00e2micas sobre a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lagoa de \u00d3bidos<\/strong> e a hist\u00f3rica vila amuralhada do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Castelo de \u00d3bidos<\/strong>. Podes escolher entre o desafio competitivo do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail de 22 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:00<\/strong>, grau m\u00e9dio de exig\u00eancia), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Trail de 12 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:10<\/strong>, ideal para inicia\u00e7\u00e3o ao trail running e atletas mais r\u00e1pidos) ou a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:20<\/strong>, gratuita para menores de 12 anos).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Arelho Running Team<\/strong> e limitado a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1.000 participantes<\/strong>, o evento assegura cronometragem por chip nas dist\u00e2ncias competitivas, trof\u00e9us para a geral e escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Sub-23 a M\/F 70), lembran\u00e7a *finisher*, banhos e conv\u00edvio final com p\u00e3o com chouri\u00e7o e bebida inclu\u00eddos na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Centro Cultural, Social e Recreativo Arelhense, Arelho, \u00d3bidos, Leiria<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style